abstract: >-
  Extrapolation of solar magnetic fields (potential, LFFF, NLFFF) from SDO/HMI vector
  magnetograms, field-line tracing, a per-line confidence calibrated on exact force-free fields,
  and tests of it against radiative MHD simulations.
keywords:
  - solar physics
  - NLFFF
  - magnetic field extrapolation
  - field-line reliability
